msgstr[0] "Cache IA vidé. %d entrée(s) ont été supprimée(s)."
msgstr[1] "Cache IA vidé. %d entrées ont été supprimées."

#. translators: %d: number of cached blocks removed.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:338
#, php-format
msgid "Translation Memory cleared. %d cached block was removed."
msgid_plural "Translation Memory cleared. %d cached blocks were removed."
msgstr[0] "Mémoire de traduction vidée. %d bloc mis en cache a été supprimé."
msgstr[1] ""
"Mémoire de traduction vidée. %d blocs mis en cache ont été supprimés."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:77
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge is a complete multilingual SEO solution. No additional SEO "
"plugin is required."
msgstr ""
"Lingua Forge est une solution SEO multilingue complète. Aucun plugin SEO "
"supplémentaire n'est requis."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:85
msgid ""
"If you have a general SEO plugin installed, this panel shows how LF adapts "
"to avoid duplicate output. The goal is collision avoidance — not "
"cooperation. LF always provides the multilingual SEO layer (hreflang, og:"
"locale, inLanguage schema) that requires knowledge of LF's language routing "
"configuration to produce correctly."
msgstr ""
"Si vous avez installé un plugin SEO général, ce panneau montre comment LF "
"s'adapte pour éviter la sortie en double. L'objectif est d'éviter les "
"collisions — pas la coopération. LF fournit toujours la couche SEO "
"multilingue (hreflang, og:locale, schéma inLanguage) qui nécessite la "
"connaissance de la configuration de routage linguistique de LF pour produire "
"correctement."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:93
msgid "Installed SEO plugins"
msgstr "Plugins SEO installés"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:98
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SystemPanel.php:560
msgid "Plugin"
msgstr "Plugin"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:99
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Statut"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:108
msgid "✓ Active"
msgstr "✓ Actif"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:110
msgid "— Not detected"
msgstr "— Non détecté"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:120
msgid ""
"No conflicting SEO plugins detected. Lingua Forge is handling all SEO output "
"independently."
msgstr ""
"Aucun plugin SEO en conflit détecté. Lingua Forge gère toute la sortie SEO "
"de manière indépendante."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:125
msgid "What LF provides — and collision avoidance"
msgstr "Ce que LF fournit — et évitement des collisions"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:130
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/UsageStatsPanel.php:153
#: ai/includes/Core/PrivacyIntegration.php:117
msgid "Feature"
msgstr "Fonctionnalité"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:131
msgid "LF provides"
msgstr "LF fournit"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:132
msgid "When another SEO plugin is installed"
msgstr "Lorsqu'un autre plugin SEO est installé"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:139
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/SeoTab.php:50
msgid "Hreflang"
msgstr "Hreflang"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:142
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:179
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:211
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:237
msgid "Disabled (by setting)"
msgstr "Désactivé (par paramètre)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:145
msgid "✓ LF outputs — plugin hreflang suppressed"
msgstr "✓ Sorties LF — hreflang du plugin supprimé"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:149
msgid "✓ LF outputs"
msgstr "✓ Sorties LF"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:155
msgid ""
"LF outputs accurate hreflang for every configured language, including x-"
"default. General SEO plugins have no access to your LF routing configuration "
"and would produce hreflang based on incorrect URL assumptions. LF suppresses "
"their output via filter to prevent collisions."
msgstr ""
"LF fournit un hreflang précis pour chaque langue configurée, y compris x-"
"default. Les plugins SEO généraux n'ont pas accès à votre configuration de "
"routage LF et produiraient des hreflang basés sur des suppositions d'URL "
"incorrectes. LF supprime leur sortie via un filtre pour éviter les "
"collisions."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of suppressed plugin names
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:163
#, php-format
msgid "Suppressed: %s."
msgstr "Supprimé : %s."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:176
msgid "Open Graph"
msgstr "Open Graph"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:181
msgid "Disabled (mode setting)"
msgstr "Désactivé (mode paramètre)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:184
msgid "→ Locale tags only — deferring base OG to plugin"
msgstr "→ Balises de localisation uniquement — report du OG de base au plugin"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:188
msgid "→ Locale tags only (manual setting)"
msgstr "→ Balises de localisation uniquement (paramètre manuel)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:192
msgid "✓ LF outputs full OG + Twitter Cards"
msgstr "✓ Sorties LF OG complet + Twitter Cards"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:198
msgid ""
"LF always adds og:locale and og:locale:alternate — the multilingual OG "
"signals no general SEO plugin can produce correctly. For the base OG set (og:"
"title, og:description, og:image), LF outputs it when no other plugin is "
"present. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF skips the base set to avoid "
"duplicate tags — not because the plugin is \"better\", but because "
"duplication produces no value."
msgstr ""
"LF ajoute toujours og:locale et og:locale:alternate — les signaux OG "
"multilingues qu'aucun plugin SEO ne peut produire correctement. Pour "
"l'ensemble OG de base (og:title, og:description, og:image), LF le sort "
"lorsque aucun autre plugin n'est présent. Lorsqu'un plugin SEO est installé, "
"LF saute l'ensemble de base pour éviter les balises en double — pas parce "
"que le plugin est \"meilleur\", mais parce que la duplication ne produit "
"aucune valeur."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:208
msgid "Schema.org JSON-LD"
msgstr "JSON-LD Schema.org"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:214
msgid "— Deferred to plugin"
msgstr "— Reporté au plugin"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:218
msgid "✓ LF outputs Article / WebPage / WebSite"
msgstr "✓ Sorties LF Article / WebPage / WebSite"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:224
msgid ""
"LF outputs multilingual JSON-LD with inLanguage annotations tied to its "
"language routing configuration. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF disables "
"its own schema entirely: duplicate JSON-LD graphs produce validation errors "
"and there is no clean way to supplement an existing graph."
msgstr ""
"LF produit du JSON-LD multilingue avec des annotations inLanguage liées à sa "
"configuration de routage linguistique. Lorsqu'un plugin SEO est installé, LF "
"désactive entièrement son propre schéma : des graphes JSON-LD en double "
"génèrent des erreurs de validation et il n'existe pas de moyen simple de "
"compléter un graphe existant."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:234
msgid "XML Sitemap"
msgstr "Sitemap XML"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:240
msgid "✓ Active at /lf-sitemap.xml"
msgstr "✓ Actif à /lf-sitemap.xml"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:246
msgid ""
"LF generates its own sitemap with xhtml:link alternates for all translation "
"groups. When a SEO plugin is installed, it generates a separate sitemap — "
"both coexist independently. Submit both to Google Search Console: the SEO "
"plugin sitemap for content discovery, the LF sitemap for language "
"relationship signals."
msgstr ""
"LF génère son propre sitemap avec des alternances xhtml:link pour tous les "
"groupes de traduction. Lorsqu'un plugin SEO est installé, il génère un "
"sitemap séparé — les deux coexistent indépendamment. Soumettez les deux à "
"Google Search Console : le sitemap du plugin SEO pour la découverte de "
"contenu, le sitemap de LF pour les signaux de relation linguistique."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:256
msgid "Canonical tag"
msgstr "Balise canonique"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:260
msgid "✓ WP canonical replaced (self-referencing)"
msgstr "✓ Canonique WP remplacé (auto-référent)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:263
msgid "WP core canonical active (hreflang disabled)"
msgstr "Canonical WP actif (hreflang désactivé)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:268
msgid ""
"LF removes the WordPress core canonical tag and replaces it with a self-"
"referencing canonical pointing to the correct language-prefixed URL. When a "
"third-party SEO plugin (Yoast, Rank Math, AIOSEO, SEOPress) is active, LF "
"defers canonical management to that plugin entirely."
msgstr ""
"LF supprime la balise canonique du cœur WordPress et la remplace par une "
"canonique faisant référence à l'URL correcte avec le préfixe de langue. "
"Lorsqu'un plugin SEO tiers (Yoast, Rank Math, AIOSEO, SEOPress) est actif, "
"LF délègue la gestion canonique entièrement à ce plugin."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:281
msgid "Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin"
msgstr "Ancien mu-plugin lf-social-share"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:285
msgid "The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active."
msgstr "Le plugin mu lf-social-share est actif."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:287
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge's built-in Social Share and Open Graph modules cover all "
"functionality the mu-plugin provides, plus multilingual og:locale support. "
"You can safely deactivate the mu-plugin."
msgstr ""
"Les modules intégrés de partage social et Open Graph de Lingua Forge "
"couvrent toutes les fonctionnalités que fournit le mu-plugin, plus la prise "
"en charge multilingue de og:locale. Vous pouvez désactiver en toute sécurité "
"le mu-plugin."

